  "player_text": "I let the silence stand and look into the knot of guards and refugees their eyes just left, picking out which face they lingered on and who went still when I spoke.",
  "visible_motivation": "They would not answer, but their glance moved from the gate to that knot, and the crowd around us went quiet.",
  "intended_meaning": "I want to see which person in that group they are actually watching, and who reacted to the question.",
